onized a planet and now style themselves \"the Awoken.\""}],"sections":[],"image":"art/6be17562d05ffabd6d89.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OK","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_1.txt","line":5522},"alsoIn":["anomaly-barr-base-cat"]},{"id":"anomaly.1195","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"生死弥留：离去","en":"Limbo: Gone"},"texts":[{"zh":"那些外星人，在我们将其神经模式传输到机器人躯体以后，离开了我们的帝国。他们在某一个清晨聚集在一小群民用航天器上，设定了前往遥远星系的航线。到目前为止，我们还没有听到他们的回音，我们可能永远不会知道他们是否到达了目的地。","en":"The aliens, whose minds we uploaded to robotic bodies, have left. They gathered early one morning on a small fleet of civilian spacecraft, setting course for a distant star system. So far we haven't heard back from them and we may never learn whether they reached their destination."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/602eb656c2e9a341b17b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OK","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_1.txt","line":5506},"alsoIn":["anomaly-barr-base-cat"]},{"id":"anomaly.1198","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"生死弥留：新的开始","en":"Limbo: a New Beginning"},"texts":[{"zh":"在多次尝试之后，工程部门终于将灭绝的外星人的神经扫描结果上传到了机器人中，结果十分令人惊喜。古代外星人已经彻底恢复了意识，并表达了加入我们帝国的意愿，希望我们能够允许他们在我们领域内的一个新星球上进行殖民。","en":"After many trials the engineering department has finally managed to transfer the extinct aliens' neural scans to robotic bodies, and the results are exhilarating. The ancient aliens have fully regained consciousness and have expressed a desire to join our empire, requesting our permission to colonize a new planet within our borders."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/457068dfc94aacecf6d6.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"anomaly.189.a","label":{"zh":"荣幸之至。","en":"We would be honored."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"外星人加入我方帝国并在[new_colony.GetName]定居。","en":"The aliens join our empire and colonize [