e exhilarating. The ancient aliens have fully regained consciousness and have expressed a desire to strike out on their own and rebuild their empire. Our Waystation network has charted a world that could serve as their new home."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/457068dfc94aacecf6d6.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"anomaly.189.c","label":{"zh":"拆掉它们。","en":"Dismantle them."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"清除[Root.Capital.GetName]的数据库中的神经网路投影。","en":"Purge the neural scans from the databanks on [Root.Capital.GetName]."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_policy_flag","arg":"ai_servitude","scope":"","value":true}]]},{"key":"anomaly.1200.a","label":{"zh":"让他们去我们驿站附近的一颗星球。","en":"Direct them to a world near our Waystations."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"外星人们将去其它地方安家。","en":"The aliens will look for a new home elsewhere."}],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"anomaly.1196","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"10"}],"source":"events/anomaly_events_1.txt:6165","story":"event-anomaly-1193"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_policy_flag","arg":"ai_outlawed","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"any_owned_nonprimary_starbase","arg":"{…}","scope":"","value":true}]],"allow":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_policy_flag","arg":"ai_outlawed","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"any_owned_nonprimary_starbase","arg":"{…}","scope":"","value":true}]],"sets":["limbo_country","synthetic_empire"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_1.txt","line":5948},"names":{"Root.Capital.GetName":{"zh":"我们的首都","en":"our capital world","note":{"zh":"游戏里这里会出现你的首都星球名称。","en":"In the game, your capital world's name appears here."}}},"alsoIn":["anomaly-barr-base-cat"]},{"id":"anomaly.1199","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"生死弥留：觉醒","en":"Limbo: Awakening"},"texts":[{"zh":"在多次尝试之后，工程部门终于将灭绝外星人的神经扫描结果上传到了机器人中，结果十分令人惊喜。古代外星人已经彻底恢复了意识，并表达了要重建自己帝国的意愿。","en":"After many trials the engineering department has finally managed to transfer the extinct aliens' neural scans to robotic bodies, and the results are exhilarating. The ancient aliens have fully regained consciousness and have expressed a desire to strike out on their own and rebuild their empire."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/457068dfc94aacecf6d6.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"anomaly.189.c","label":{"zh":"拆掉它们。","en":"Dismantle them."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"清除[Root.Capital.GetName]的数据库中的神经网路投影。","en":"Purge the neural scans from the databanks on [Root.Capital.GetName]."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_policy_flag","arg":"ai_servitude","scope":"","value":true}]]},{"key":"anomaly.1199.a","label":{"zh":"我们不会阻拦。","en":"We won't stand in their way."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"外星人们将去其它地方安家。","en":"The aliens will look for a new home elsewhere."}],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"anomaly.1196","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"10"}],"source":"events/anomaly_events_1.txt:5940","story":"event-anomaly-1193"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_policy_flag","arg":"ai_outlawed","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"any_system","arg":"{…}","scope":"","value":true}]],"allow":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_policy_flag","arg":"ai_outlawed","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"any_system","arg":"{…}","scope":"","value":true}]],"sets":["limbo_country","synthetic_empire"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_1.txt","line":5677},"names":{"Root.Capital.GetName":{"zh":"我们的首都","en":"our capital world","note":{"zh":"游戏里这里会出现你的首都星球名称。","en":"In the game, your capital world's name appears here."}}},"alsoIn":["anomaly-barr-base-cat"]},{"id":"anomaly.1190","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"生死弥留：线缆中的灵魂","en":"Limbo: Spirits in the Wires"},"texts":[{"zh":"工程部门带回了令人高度担忧的消息。在“生死弥留”项目期限最后一天的工作中，科学家们再一次尝试将外星人的神经扫描结果上传到机器人身体的工作似乎还是失败了，但在第二天科学家们回来的时候，却发现那些机器人都不见了。\n\n有些人猜测，上传尝试其实已经成功了，是外星人趁夜间瞧瞧出逃，也有人说这是个精心设计的骗局。我们看来是无从确认了……","en":"The engineering department has returned with some highly disturbing news. After concluding the final day of \"Project Limbo\" with yet another seemingly failed attempt at uploading the alien neural scans to robotic bodies, the scientists returned the following day to find the robots missing.\n\nSome believe the attempt succeeded after all and that the aliens stole away in the night, others that it's an elaborate hoax. We may never know for sure..."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/6be17562d05ffabd6d89.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"anomaly.1190.a","label":{"zh":"干得漂亮。","en":"Remarkable."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_1.txt","line":5406},"alsoIn":["anomaly-barr-base-cat"]}],"summary":{"text":"# 生死弥留：科技进步 / Limbo: Technological Advances\n\n- 分类 Category：探索 Exploration · 审阅 Reviewed：2026-10-13（已审阅 reviewed）\n- 来源 Sources：events/anomaly_events_1.txt:5435 (anomaly.1193); events/anomaly_events_1.txt:5452 (anomaly.1194); common/special_projects/00_projects_3.txt:939 (LIMBO_2_PROJECT); events/anomaly_events_1.txt:5406 (anomaly.1190); common/on_actions/00_on_actions.txt:2693 (on_tech_increased → anomaly.1193); events/anomaly_events_1.txt:4991 (anomaly.186 option b sets limbo_downloaded)\n\n## 如何开始 How it starts\n\non_tech_increased：国家研究了 tech_synthetic_workers，带有 limbo_downloaded 标志（当初在“生死弥留”异常的 anomaly.186 选了“只下载脑扫描”，见 anomaly-barr-base-cat），且未禁止人工智能（ai_outlawed）。隐藏事件 anomaly.1193 在20-40天后触发 anomaly.1194。\n\non_tech_increased: the country researched tech_synthetic_workers, has the limbo_downloaded flag (it chose \"only download the brain scans\" in anomaly.186 of the Limbo anomaly, see anomaly-barr-base-cat) and does not outlaw AI (ai_outlawed). The hidden event anomaly.1193 fires anomaly.1194 20-40 days later.\n\n## 剧情脉络 Story outline\n\n1. anomaly.1194“生死弥留：科技进步”：选项a在首都启用项目 LIMBO_2_PROJECT“重获生机”（费用1000工程，无科学船要求）；选项b放弃，获得每月工程研究并清除 limbo 标志，事件链结束。\n2. 项目完成（设置 limbo_uploaded_robots），按殖民条件的 if/else 链选出一个结果：有边境内外可殖民星球 → anomaly.189“生死弥留：新的开始”；仅边境内 → anomaly.1198；游牧国家 → anomaly.1200；仅境外且有 tech_droid_workers → anomaly.1199“生死弥留：觉醒”；都没有 → anomaly.1190“生死弥留：线缆中的灵魂”。\n3. 189/1198/1200/1199 给出“荣幸接纳 / 分道扬镳 / 拆解”的选择：分道扬镳时 10 天后 anomaly.1196“生死弥留：觉醒者”（他们建立殖民地）或 40 天后 anomaly.1195“生死弥留：离去”。\n\n1. anomaly.1194 \"Limbo: Technological Advances\": option a enables project LIMBO_2_PROJECT \"A Second Chance\" at the capital (cost 1000 engineering, no science ship needed); option b gives it up for monthly engineering research and clears the limbo flags, ending the chain.\n2. When the project completes (sets limbo_uploaded_robots), an if/else chain on colonisable planets picks one result: colonisable planets inside and outside borders → anomaly.189 \"Limbo: a New Beginning\"; inside only → anomaly.1198; nomads → anomaly.1200; outside only and tech_droid_workers → anomaly.1199 \"Limbo: Awakening\"; none → anomaly.1190 \"Limbo: Spirits in the Wires\".\n3. 189 / 1198 / 1200 / 1199 offer \"be honoured / part ways / dismantle\": parting ways leads 10 days later to anomaly.1196 \"Limbo: the Awoken\" (they found a colony) or 40 days later to anomaly.1195 \"Limbo: Gone\".\n\n## 分支与结局 Branches and outcomes\n\n项目完成后的五个结果互斥（if/else 链，按可殖民星球的位置）；189 的“分道扬镳”再分为 1196 / 1195（取决于是否有边境外的可殖民星球）。\n\nThe five results after the project are exclusive (an if/else chain on where colonisable planets are); parting ways in 189 then splits into 1196 / 1195 (depending on colonisable planets outside the borders).\n\n## 条件与文明差异 Conditions and variants\n\nanomaly.1194 的选项a在 ai_outlawed 下不可用；游牧国家走单独分支（1200）。\n\nanomaly.1194's option a is unavailable under ai_outlawed; nomad empires take their own branch (1200).\n\n## 审阅记录 Review notes\n\n已核对 anomaly.1193/1194、LIMBO_2_PROJECT 的 if/else 结果链与编译树；树正确。这是“生死弥留”故事（c3b 的 anomaly-barr-base-cat）的另一入口：同一个项目与同样的结果文档也出现在那个故事里。\n\nChecked anomaly.1193/1194, the if/else result chain of LIMBO_2_PROJECT and the compiled tree; the tree is correct. This is an alternative entry to the Limbo story (c3b's anomaly-barr-base-cat): the same project and result docs also appear in that story.\n","path":"summaries/event-anomaly-1193.md"}}